{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20553","headline":"酬杭州白使君兼寄浙东元大夫 · 张籍","name":"酬杭州白使君兼寄浙东元大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相印暂离临远镇，掖垣出守复同时。\n一行已作三年别，两处空传七字诗。\n越地江山应共见，秦天风月不相知。\n人间聚散真难料，莫叹平生信所之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}